---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Léa Giezek - Experience systems that grow culture"
  description="Design and experience systems lead. Fifteen years across brand, retail, agency and product - I don't systematize what I haven't practiced."
  loader>

<!-- CARD 1 : banner + intro -->
  <div class="card">
    <div class="banner">
      <div class="banner__photo" role="img" aria-label="Portrait of Léa Giezek"></div>
      <div class="banner__inner">
        <p class="banner__standards">Design systems ship standards.</p>
        <p class="banner__grow">Experience systems grow <span class="banner__culture">culture</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="intro" id="intro">
      <div class="intro__id">
        <div class="intro__photo" role="img" aria-label="Portrait of Léa Giezek"></div>
        <div class="intro__text">
          <h1 class="intro__name">Léa Giezek</h1>
          <p class="intro__lead">Fifteen years across brand, retail, agency and product - every rung of the craft before the direction. I don't systematize what I haven't practiced - and I nurture the practice and the people, not just the system.</p>
          <div class="intro__cta"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/philosophy">Philosophy →</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CRAFT TILES on the grey canvas -->
  <div class="drag" id="drag" aria-label="Craft and portrait">
        <div class="dcard dcard--photo" style="left:0%;top:108px;--rot:-3deg" role="img" aria-label="Portrait of Léa Giezek"></div>
        <div class="dcard dc1 dcard--flip dc1--grid" style="left:42%;top:96px;--rot:-1deg">
          <div class="dcard__inner">
            <div class="dcard__face dcard__front"><p class="dcard__t">Design in my own hands.</p></div>
            <div class="dcard__face dcard__back"><p class="dcard__b">I've designed <b>the brand, the product, the system</b> - so when I set direction, it's <b>grounded in the work, not above it.</b></p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dcard dc2 dcard--flip dc2--flip" style="left:70%;top:12px;--rot:3deg">
          <div class="dcard__inner">
            <div class="dcard__face dcard__front"><p class="dcard__t">Enough engineering to earn the room.</p><span class="dc2__kbd"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="3" width="12" height="18" rx="6"/><path d="M12 7v3"/></svg>Ctrl + Cmd + C</span></div>
            <div class="dcard__face dcard__back"><p class="dcard__b"><b>I read the code and ran component QA myself</b> - to back my team up when they needed it, and to understand the work well enough <b>never to decide against it.</b></p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dcard dc3 dcard--flip" style="left:23%;top:0px;--rot:-5deg">
          <div class="dcard__inner">
            <div class="dcard__face dcard__front"><p class="dcard__t">I lead the way I learned: hands dirty first.</p><span class="dc-hand" aria-hidden="true">🖍️</span></div>
            <div class="dcard__face dcard__back"><p class="dcard__b"><b>I've done the work myself</b>, so I <b>empower the people</b> doing it now - close enough to help when it counts, <b>never close enough to hover.</b></p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  <div class="dots" id="dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Tiles"><button class="dot" data-i="0" role="tab" aria-label="Tile 1"></button><button class="dot" data-i="1" role="tab" aria-label="Tile 2"></button><button class="dot" data-i="2" role="tab" aria-label="Tile 3"></button></div>

  <!-- OPERATING SYSTEM bridge -->
  <section class="osbridge" aria-labelledby="os-title">
    <div class="osbridge__body">
      <h2 class="osbridge__title" id="os-title">The best governance is the kind you don't have to police.</h2>
      <p class="osbridge__text">Rigor and care aren't opposites - they're the same discipline. Every principle here trades the easy version for the one that lasts: discovery before code, ethics before AI, wellbeing before delivery. <b>Distribute the ownership, or become the bottleneck.</b></p>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/operating-system">Operating System →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="osbridge__viz">
      <div class="osbridge__visual" aria-hidden="true">🎮</div>
      <div class="osbridge__mini" aria-hidden="true">🏳️‍🌈</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- I don't build design systems -->
  <section class="betlede">
    <h2 class="osbridge__title">I don't build design systems. I build experience systems.</h2>
    <p class="osbridge__text">Fifty would be padding. Three prove it - a platform, an organisation, and a space you could immerse yourself in. <b>Same thinking, three worlds - no craft left in a silo.</b></p>
  </section>
  <div class="cases">
    <div class="case">
      <div class="case__top"><span class="case__idx">Systematized a practice</span><span class="case__when">2023 - now</span><span class="case__name">Digital</span></div>
      <div class="case__body">
        <p class="case__hook"><b>The product failed. The platform scaled.</b> Same system, rebuilt from zero - into the standard a strategic digital portfolio depends on, and the community that makes it last.</p>
        <a class="btn3" href="/system-practice-elements">Read more <span class="btn3__i">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="case">
      <div class="case__top"><span class="case__idx">Systematized a brand</span><span class="case__when">2018 - 2021</span><span class="case__name">Brand</span></div>
      <div class="case__body">
        <p class="case__hook">2,500 people, one language - before I'd have called it a design system. Not just product, not just design, not just communication: <b>anything can be systematized</b> once you understand each craft, and how to connect the dots. The pattern, five years early.</p>
        <a class="btn3" href="/system-brand">Read more <span class="btn3__i">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="case">
      <div class="case__top"><span class="case__idx">Systematized a moment</span><span class="case__when">a year in the making</span><span class="case__name">Event</span></div>
      <div class="case__body">
        <p class="case__hook">A full identity, a staged space, and an escape game - one live experience, orchestrated end to end. The same thinking, off the screen entirely. <b>Proof it travels anywhere.</b></p>
        <a class="btn3" href="/system-event">Read more <span class="btn3__i">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CARD 3 : let's talk -->

</Base>

<style is:global>
  .banner__standards{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .banner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;min-height:0;padding:calc(var(--mobbar-h) + 16px) clamp(20px,5vw,28px) clamp(32px,11vw,96px)}
    .banner__inner{padding:0;margin-top:clamp(16px,4vw,24px)}
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  (function(){
    var reduce=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
/* draggable craft cards */
    var z=10;
    [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.dcard')).forEach(function(c){
      if(c.classList.contains('dcard--photo')) return;
      if(c.classList.contains('dcard--flip')){ c.addEventListener('click',function(){ c.classList.toggle('flipped'); }); return; }
      var ox=0,oy=0,dragging=false;
      c.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){
        if(window.matchMedia('(max-width:720px)').matches) return;
        dragging=true; c.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); c.classList.add('grabbing'); c.style.zIndex=++z;
        var r=c.getBoundingClientRect();
        ox=e.clientX-r.left; oy=e.clientY-r.top;
      });
      c.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){
        if(!dragging) return;
        var p=c.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();
        var x=e.clientX-p.left-ox, y=e.clientY-p.top-oy;
        x=Math.max(0,Math.min(x,p.width-c.offsetWidth));
        y=Math.max(0,Math.min(y,p.height-c.offsetHeight));
        c.style.left=x+'px'; c.style.top=y+'px';
      });
      function end(){ dragging=false; c.classList.remove('grabbing'); }
      c.addEventListener('pointerup',end); c.addEventListener('pointercancel',end);
    });
    var dragEl=document.getElementById("drag");
    if(dragEl){
      if(reduce){ dragEl.classList.add("in"); }
      else{
        if("IntersectionObserver" in window){
          var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){dragEl.classList.add("in");io.disconnect();}});},{threshold:0,rootMargin:"0px 0px -60px 0px"});
          io.observe(dragEl);
        }
        setTimeout(function(){ dragEl.classList.add("in"); }, 2200);
      }
    }
    var talkEl=document.querySelector(".talk-card");
    if(talkEl && !reduce){
      if("IntersectionObserver" in window){
        var io2=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){talkEl.classList.add("in");io2.disconnect();}});},{threshold:0.2});
        io2.observe(talkEl);
      } else { talkEl.classList.add("in"); }
    }
    /* ---- carousel: center card 2, dots, expand ---- */
    (function(){
      var drag=document.getElementById("drag"); if(!drag) return;
      var dotsWrap=document.getElementById("dots");
      var flips=[].slice.call(drag.querySelectorAll(".dcard--flip"));
      var dots=dotsWrap?[].slice.call(dotsWrap.querySelectorAll(".dot")):[];
      var mq=window.matchMedia("(max-width:1024px)");
      function carousel(){ return mq.matches; }
      function centerOf(card){ return card.offsetLeft + card.offsetWidth/2; }
      function scrollToCard(i,smooth){ var card=flips[i]; if(!card) return; var t=card.offsetLeft-(drag.clientWidth-card.offsetWidth)/2; t=Math.max(0,Math.min(t,drag.scrollWidth-drag.clientWidth)); drag.scrollTo({left:t,behavior:smooth?"smooth":"auto"}); }
      function activeIndex(){ var mid=drag.scrollLeft+drag.clientWidth/2,best=0,bd=Infinity; flips.forEach(function(card,i){var d=Math.abs(centerOf(card)-mid); if(d<bd){bd=d;best=i;}}); return best; }
      function syncDots(){ var a=activeIndex(); dots.forEach(function(d,i){var on=i===a; d.classList.toggle("is-active",on); d.setAttribute("aria-selected",on?"true":"false");}); }
      dots.forEach(function(d,i){ d.addEventListener("click",function(){ scrollToCard(i,true); }); });
      function applyArc(){ if(!carousel()){ flips.forEach(function(c){ c.style.transform=""; }); return; } var mid=drag.scrollLeft+drag.clientWidth/2; flips.forEach(function(card){ var d=(centerOf(card)-mid)/drag.clientWidth; if(d>1)d=1; if(d<-1)d=-1; card.style.transform="translateY("+(Math.abs(d)*22).toFixed(1)+"px) rotate("+(d*6.5).toFixed(2)+"deg) scale("+(1-Math.abs(d)*0.055).toFixed(3)+")"; }); }
      var raf; drag.addEventListener("scroll",function(){ if(raf)cancelAnimationFrame(raf); raf=requestAnimationFrame(function(){ syncDots(); applyArc(); }); });
      function centerInit(){ if(carousel()){ scrollToCard(1,false); syncDots(); applyArc(); } else { flips.forEach(function(c){ c.style.transform=""; }); } }
      function onChange(){ centerInit(); }
      if(mq.addEventListener) mq.addEventListener("change",onChange); else if(mq.addListener) mq.addListener(onChange);
      centerInit();
      window.addEventListener("load",centerInit);
    })();
    var loaderEl=document.getElementById("loader");
    if(loaderEl){
      if(reduce){ loaderEl.style.display="none"; }
      else{
        var fly=document.getElementById("fly");
        var panel=loaderEl.querySelector(".loader__panel");
        var badge=document.querySelector(".banner__pepper");
        var done=false;
        function finishLoader(){ if(done)return; done=true; if(badge) badge.style.opacity="1"; loaderEl.style.display="none"; }
        setTimeout(function(){
          if(!badge){ panel.style.opacity="0"; setTimeout(finishLoader,600); return; }
          var t=badge.getBoundingClientRect(), f=fly.getBoundingClientRect();
          var dx=(t.left+t.width/2)-(f.left+f.width/2);
          var dy=(t.top+t.height/2)-(f.top+f.height/2);
          var s=t.width/f.width;
          badge.style.opacity="0";
          panel.style.opacity="0";
          fly.style.transform="translate(calc(-50% + "+dx+"px), calc(-50% + "+dy+"px)) scale("+s+")";
        },1150);
        fly.addEventListener("transitionend",function(e){ if(e.propertyName==="transform") finishLoader(); });
        setTimeout(finishLoader,2600);
      }
    }
  })();
</script>
